1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was the owner of the 'Herrschaft' Oberbronn in the Alsace (Northwest of Strasbourg). On his death in 1665 ownership was split between his two daughters. From 1763 up to the French Revolution, ownership was split
2 CONC  between the descendants of his daughters (Graf von Hohenlohe-Bartenstein, and Comte de Loewenhaupt) and the Baron von Dietrich, who had bought a share. See document attached.<br/>
