2 CONT Johann Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 16 August 1578. He was the son of Karl II Graf von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Euphrosyne Gräfin von Oettingen-Wallerstein. He married Johanna Gräfin von Hohenzollern-Hechinge
2 CONC n, daughter of Eitel Friedrich IV Graf von Hohenzollern-Hechingen, in 1602. He died in 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Johann Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen gained the title of Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.
2 CONT
