1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00106788&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Marie Sidonie was born in 1604 or 1605, the daughter of Philipp Franz von Daun, Graf von Falkenstein, and Gräfin Elisabeth zu Salm-Reifferscheidt. On 21 October 1624 she married Adam Philipp, Graf von Kronberg. Their dau
2 CONC ghter Magdalena would have progeny, marrying Philipp Franz, Freiherr von Sötern. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Adam Philipp died in 1634, and on 29 September 1636 at Kastellaun Marie became the second wife of Hermann Fortunaus, Markgraf von Baden zu Rodemachern, second son of Eduard Fortunatus, Markgraf von Baden-Baden, and Maria van der E
2 CONC ycken, Vrouwe van Rivieren. Of their two children, Marie Eleonore would have progeny, marrying Johann Franz Desideratus, Fürst von Nassau-Siegen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie died in Diedenhofen on 3 May 1675.
