1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Maria Katharina von Braunschweig-Lunenburg-Dannenberg Guelph, Duchess of Mecklenburg-Schwerin=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Julius Ernst von Braunschweig-Dannenberg and Maria von Ostfriesland 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Adolf Frederick,''' he married for a second time in 1635 to Marie Katharina (1616–1665), daughter of Duke Julius Ernest, Duke of Brunswick-Dannenberg, and Maria of East Frisia (1582–1616). - https://en.m.wikipedia.or
2 CONC g/wiki/Adolf_Frederick_I,_Duke_of_Mecklenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT =They had the following children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Juliane Sibylla Schwerin,''' 16 February 1636 – Rühn, 2 October 1701), Abbess of Rühn (9 March 1695).
2 CONT * '''Frederick I Schwerin,'''13 February 1638 – Schloss Grabow, 28 April 1688), Duke of Mecklenburg-Grabow.
2 CONT * '''Christina Schwerin, ''' 8 August 1639 – Gandersheim, 30 June 1693), Abbess of Gandersheim (1681).
2 CONT * '''Bernhard Sigismund  (Schwerin,''' 21 January 1641 – Schwerin, 15 November 1641).
2 CONT * '''Augusta Schwerin,''' 24 September 1643 – Schwerin, 5 May 1644).
2 CONT * '''Maria Elisabeth Schwerin,''' 24 March 1646 – Gandersheim, 27 April 1713), Abbess of Rühn (1705), Abbess of Gandersheim (1712).
2 CONT * '''Anna Sophia Schwerin,''' 24 November 1647 – Juliusburg, 13 August 1723), married in 1677 to Julius Siegmund, Duke of Württemberg-Juliusburg.
2 CONT * '''Adolph Ernest Schwerin,''' 22 November 1650 – Schwerin, 13 January 1651).
2 CONT * '''Philipp Louis Schwerin,''' 30 May 1652 – Schwerin, 20 October 1655).
2 CONT * '''Henry William Schwerin,''' 6 June 1653 – Schwerin, 2 December 1653).
2 CONT * '''Adolf Frederick II, posthumously Grabow,''' 19 October 1658 – 12 May 1708), Duke of Mecklenburg-Strelitz.
2 CONT
