2 CONT *[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Wilhelm_of_Prussia_(1783%E2%80%931851)_ Wikipedia] Christian Ludwig van Brunswijk Luneburg was born on 21 Aug 1621 in Rhein, Oberbergischer Kreis, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Germany.  He was the son
2 CONC  of Georg von (Duke of Brunswick) Braunschweig-Lüneburg (1582-1641) and Anne Eleonore Princess of Hesse-Darmstadt (1601-1659).
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian married Maria Schaeffer (1623-1689).  She was the daughter of Hans Johannes Schafer (1595-1679) and Anna (Hamp) Schaeffer (1598-1678).
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian and Maria Ludwig were the parents of the following known children:  Catharina Ludwig, Martin Ludwig, Elisabetha Ludwig, Christian Ludwig, Melchior Ludwig, Barbara Ludwig, Peter Ludwig and Andreas Ludwig.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/144233416/christian-ludwig Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 21 2021, 14:47:48 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/144233416/christian-ludwig
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Ludwig van Brunswijk Luneburg was born on 21 Aug 1621 in Rhein, Oberbergischer Kreis, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Germany.  He was the son of Georg von (Duke of Brunswick) Braunschweig-Lüneburg (1582-1641) and Anne Eleonore Pri
2 CONC ncess of Hesse-Darmstadt (1601-1659).
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian married Maria Schaeffer (1623-1689).  She was the daughter of Hans Johannes Schafer (1595-1679) and Anna (Hamp) Schaeffer (1598-1678).
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian and Maria Ludwig were the parents of the following known children:  Catharina Ludwig, Martin Ludwig, Elisabetha Ludwig, Christian Ludwig, Melchior Ludwig, Barbara Ludwig, Peter Ludwig and Andreas Ludwig.* Reference: [htt
