2 CONC 6000000002632163398 Maximilian I]
2 CONT
2 CONT Meinrad I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born in 1605. He was the son of Johann Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen. He married Anna Maria von Töring on 7 May 1635. He died in 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Meinrad I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen gained the title of Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Meinrad I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Anna Maria von Töring
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Maximilian I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen+1 b. 20 Jan 1636, d. 1689
