2 CONT *'''Margrave of Baden-Durlach''' Reign 1659 - 1677 
2 CONT >'''Predecesssor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000009214864409 Frederick V]  '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000001341078095 Frederick VII]
