1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johann Philipp Graf zu Salm-Dhaun (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #223428, b. 28 October 1645, d. 26 January 1693
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT      Johann Philipp Graf zu Salm-Dhaun was born on 28 October 1645 at Dhaun. (1) He was the son of Johann Ludwig zu Salm-Dhaun and Elisabeth zu Salm-Neuviller. (1) He married Anna Katharina Gräfin von Nassau-Ottweiler, daughter of
2 CONC  Johann Ludwig Graf von Nassau-Ottweiler and Dorothea Katharina Pfalzgräfin von Birkenfeld, on 11 November 1671. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 26 January 1693 at age 47 at Dhaun. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Johann Philipp Graf zu Salm-Dhaun and Anna Katharina Gräfin von Nassau-Ottweiler
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Karl Graf zu Salm-Dhaun+1 b. 21 Sep 1675, d. 26 Mar 1733
2 CONT
