1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thompson, Anthony,Dorchester Co.,2nd Jan., 1701; 4th June, 1707. To son Henry and hrs., dwelling plantation, 50 A., “White Haven” and 25 A., “Greenbank.” To son Anthony and hrs., ½ of 100 A., “Thompson's Range” on 
2 CONC Black Water and “Green Bank” afsd., should son Henry die without issue. To son Richard and hrs., 136 A., “West Phalia” and “Thompson's Range” afsd., should son Anthony die without issue. To son Thomas and hrs., 50 A., “Thompson's 
2 CONC Desire” and “West Phalia” afsd., should son Richard die without issue. To dau. Ellinor and hrs., personalty. Exs.: Wife ––, and son Henry. Test: Wm. Mackeel, Wm. Campbell, Wm. Douse. 12. 178.
2 CONT
