1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Henriette Louise Wilhelmine zur Lippe-Biesterfeld===
2 CONT * was born 26 June 1711 in Biesterfeld to Rudolf Ferdinand zur Lippe-Biesterfeld (1671-1736) and Juliane Luise von Kunowitz (1671-1754) and died 29 September 1752 in Baruth of unspecified causes. 
2 CONT * She married '''Johann Karl De Solms-Baruth''' (1702-1735) 11 January 1729 in Biesterfeld. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Notable ancestors include Charlemagne (747-814), Alfred the Great (849-899), Hugh Capet (c940-996), Rurik (c832-879), Henry II of England (1133-1189), William I of England (1027-1087). Ancestors are from France, Belgium, Germany
2 CONC , Byzantium, the United Kingdom, Russia, Belarus, Hungary, the Netherlands, Spain, the Czech Republic, Italy, Austria, Switzerland, Bohemia, Denmark, Poland, Lithuania.
