2 _MARNM Brake
1 NAME Johan Jacob, "Baron von" Brake
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1690 AND 1705
2 PLAC Hannover, Stadt Hannover, Niedersachsen
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 JUN 1762
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johann Jacob Brake Birth 1695-1705 in Hannover, Stadt Hannover, Niedersachsen, Germany Death June 1, 1762 in Frederick County, Virginia, United States
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Original family name probably Brecht or Brechtel. Emigrated to America, possibly from Eschelbach, southeast of Heidelberg, with wife and children sometime before 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT In America became wealthy enough in both money and land to style himself "Baron", whether or not he really was descended from German nobility.
2 CONT
2 CONT Place of death possibly Moorefield, Hardy County, Virginia (now West Virginia), United States
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT It appears that Johann Jacob Brake, born about 1695 in Germany was first married to Anna Susanna Eva Wegwese (1700 - 1719) and later to Margaret Elizabeth Keiffer (1713 - 1812).  He appears to have been the father of Johann Jacob 
2 CONC Brake, Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Jacob Brake (1695) was either the father or grandfather of Johann Jacob Brake, born 1725.  It seems highly unlikely that another generation occurred in the 30 years between 1695 and 1725.  Therefore, it is assumed that the 
2 CONC above mentioned people at Jr. and Sr. - Johann Jacob Brake.
2 CONT
2 CONT See - https://www.geni.com/people/Johan-Jacob-Baron-von-Brake/6000000024518293350?through=6000000024518301462
2 CONT
2 CONT See - http://news.rootsweb.com/th/read/BRAKE/2003-01/1041986253
