1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #46132, b. 21 January 1702, d. 25 January 1751
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=8 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT      Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm was born on 21 January 1702. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Ludwig Otto Prinz zu Salm and Albertine Johannette Prinzessin von Nassau-Hadamar. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm on 25 March 1719. She died on 25 January 1751 at age 49.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm gained the title of Prinzessin zu Salm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm and Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm
