2 CONT M, #97899, d. 1770
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=15 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm married Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm, daughter of Ludwig Otto Prinz zu Salm and Albertine Johannette Prinzessin von Nassau-Hadamar, on 25 March 1719. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1770.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinz zu Salm-Salm.
2 CONT
