1 NOTE {geni:about_me} hhttp://genealogy.euweb.cz/baden/baden3.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Markgraf Christof I von Baden (1475-15), *13.11.1453, +Schloß Hohenbaden 19.4.1527; m.Koblenz 19.12.1468 Ottilie von Katzenelnbogen (*ca 1451 +Baden 15.8.1517); They had issue:
2 CONT *A1. Jakob II, Archbishop of Trier (1503-11), *1471, +Köln 1511
2 CONT *A2. Markgraf Bernhard IV von Baden-Baden (1515-36), *7.4.1474, +Baden 29.6.1536; m.Francoise de Luxembourg, heiress of Roussy and Pittingen (+17.6.1566)
2 CONT **
2 CONT **B2. Markgraf Christof II von Baden-Rodemachern, *Baden 26.2.1537, +Rodemachern 2.8.1575; m.Stockholm 18.6.1564 Pss Caecilie of Sweden (*6.11.1540 +27.1.1627)
2 CONT ***C1. Markgraf Eduard Fortunatus von Baden-Baden (1588-96), *London 17.9.1565, +Kastellaun 18.6.1600; m.Brussels 13.3.1591 Marie von Eicken (+21.4.1636)
2 CONT ****D1. Markgraf Wilhelm von Baden-Baden (1621-77), *Baden 30.7.1593, +Baden 22.5.1677; 1m: 1624 Pss Katharine Ursula von Hohenzollern-Hechingen (+1640); 2m: Vienna 1650 Gfn Marie Magdalene von Oettingen (*1619 +31.8.1688)
2 CONT *****E1. [1m.] Ferdinand Maximilian, *Baden 23.9.1625, +Heidelberg 4.11.1669; m.Paris 1653 Pss Luisa Francesca of Savoy-Carignano (*1.8.1627 +7.7.1689)
2 CONT ****** ...
2 CONT *****E2. [1m.] Leopold Wilhelm, an imperial Field Marshal, *16.9.1626, +Baden-Baden 23.2.1671; 1m: 1659 Anna Silvia Carretto, Ctsa di Millesimo (*1607, +26.2.1664); 2m: 23.2.1666 Gfn Marie Franziska von Fürstenberg-Heiligenberg(*1
2 CONC 8.5.1633 +7.3.1702)
2 CONT ****** ...
2 CONT *****E3. [1m.] Philipp Siegmund, Malta Order Knight, *1627, +k.a.Orbitello 1647
2 CONT *****E4. [1m.] Wilhelm Christof, a canon in Köln, *Baden 1628, +1652
2 CONT *****E5. [1m.] Hermann, *Baden 1628, +Ratisbon 1691
2 CONT *****E6. [1m.] Bernhard, *1629, +Rome 1648
2 CONT *****E7. [1m.] Franz, *and +1637
2 CONT *****E8. [2m.] Philipp Franz Wilhelm, *Baden 1652, +1655
2 CONT *****E9. [2m.] Karl Bernhard, *Baden 1657, +k.a.Rheinfelden 1678
2 CONT *****E10. [1m.] Isabella Eugenie Klara, *1630, +1632
2 CONT *****E11. [1m.] Katharina Franziska Henriette, a nun, *1631, +Besancon 1691
2 CONT *****E12. [1m.] Klaudia, *1633, +young
2 CONT *****E13. [1m.] Henriette, *1634, +young
2 CONT *****E14. [1m.] Anna, *1634, +Baden 1708
2 CONT *****E15. [1m.] Marie, *and +1636
2 CONT *****E16. [1m.] Marie Juliane, *and +1638
2 CONT *****E17. [2m.] Marie Anna Wilhelmine, *Baden 8.9.1655, +Cheb (Eger) 22.8.1702; m.Baden 17.7.1680 Fst Ferdinand August von Lobkowitz (*7.9.1655 +3.10.1715)
2 CONT *****E18. [2m.] Eva
2 CONT *****E19. [2m.] '''Marie'''
2 CONT **** ...
