4 CONC e (1795-1870). His mother died May 09, 1859 ''am Teichdamm, Wernigerode''
3 NOTE Wernigerode is about 111 km (63 miles +/-) from Halle. 
4 CONT https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Wernigerode,+Germany/Halle+(Saale),+Germany/@51.4090407,10.6761406,148589m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m13!4m12!1m5!1m1!1s0x47a50c579534af6d:0x4236659f8072960!2m2!1d10.7844266!2d51.8368113!1m5!1m1!1s0x47a663
