1 NAME Gustaf Otto /Graf Douglas/
2 GIVN Gustaf Otto
2 _MARNM Graf Douglas
2 NICK Gustav Otto Gf. Douglas-Skenninge
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 FEB 1687
