1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johann_Josef_Anton Wikipedia - '''Joseph Johan Adam, Prince of Liechtenstein'''] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Knight  of the Order of the Golden Fleece===
2 CONT * '''661st Knight''' of the Order of the Golden Fleece
2 CONT * Born in Vienna, he was the only living son of Anton Florian, Prince of Liechtenstein. Johann Josef Adam served under his father for a short time during the War of the Spanish Succession and later fought against the French under 
2 CONC the Duke of Marlborough.  After the Treaty of Utrecht he became Imperial Privy Counsellor in Vienna.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Valice in 1732.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph '''married''' his cousin '''Gabrielle''', Princess of Liechtenstein (12 July 1692 -  7 November 1713), daughter of Hans-Adam I, on 1 December '''1712'''.  they only had one child.
2 CONT # Prince Karl Anton (1713-1715)
2 CONT
2 CONT On 3 February '''1716''' he '''married''' '''Marianne''', Countess of Thun-Hohenstein (27 September 1698- 23 February 1716). She died only 20 days adter the wedding.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 3 August '''1716''', in Vienna, he '''married''' '''Maria Anna''', Countess of Oettingen-Spielberg (12 September 1693 - 15 April 1729), daughter of Francis Albert, Count of Oettingen-Spielberg.  They had three children;
2 CONT # Prince Joseph Anton (1720 - 1723)
2 CONT # Johan Nepomuk Karl, Prince of Liechtenstein (6 july 1724 - 22 December 1748) - '''Golden Fleece Knight '''
2 CONT # Princess Maria Theresia (28 December 1721 - 1753)
2 CONT
2 CONT In '''1729''', Josef '''married''' '''Maria Anna''', Countess Kottulinsky (12 May 1707 - 6 February 1788).  This marriage was childless. (car)
