2 CONT *'''Elector of Saxony:''' Reign	27 April 1694 – 1 February 1733
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/John-George-IV-Elector-of-Saxony/6000000001469968240 John George IV] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Auguste-III/5318646737330089414 Frederick Augustus II]
