2 CONT 7 August 1785 	known as the Cardinal-Infante. Was Archbishop of Toledo, Primate of Spain and Cardinal since 1735. In 1754 renounced his ecclesiastical titles and became Count of Chinchón. In 1776, he married morganatically Doña Ma
2 CONC ría Teresa de Vallabriga y Rozas and had issue, but without royal titles.
2 CONT
2 CONT Infanta Maria Antonieta Ferdinanda
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen of Sardinia 	Maria antonia infanta spain sardinia 1729 1785.jpg 	17 November 1729 –
2 CONT
2 CONT 19 September 1785 	was Queen of Sardinia as the wife of King Victor Amadeus III of Sardinia. She was a mother of 3 rulers of Sardinia.
2 CONT
