1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. JAMES (Remy) RAMEY son of William Remy, Sr. and Catherine Asbury was born about 1715 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. He died in 1760 in Frederick County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married ELIZABETH SANDERS before 1743. She was born in Westmoreland County, Virginia. She died in Frederick County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT James Ramey and Elizabeth Sanders had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. DANIEL S. RAMEY was born in 1743 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. He died on 25 Jan 1806 in Clark, Kentucky, USA. He married RACHAEL JOHNSON.
2 CONT * ii. DAVID RAMEY was born in 1745 in Frederick County, Virginia.
2 CONT * iii. ELIZABETH RAMEY
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1654-1800 Westmoreland County, Virginia Wills [Augusta B. Fothergill];
2 CONT * REMY, WILLIAM, aged 65;
2 CONT * 19 Nov. 1737; 30 May 1738.
2 CONT * Son William; Jacob Remy's heirs; Asbury Remy;
2 CONT * dau. Mary Saunders 1 shilling; to Katherine Wormoth 1 shilling; sons John, James and Daniel; wife Katherine use of plantation for life, and at her death to son Daniel; Elizabeth Sanders 1 feather bed when she marries.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
