1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christian_Karl_Reinhard_of_Leiningen-Dachsburg-Falkenburg-Heidesheim Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Karl Reinhard Graf zu Leiningen-Dagsburg-Heidesheim (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #2903, b. 7 July 1695, d. 17 November 1766
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=20 Oct 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Christian Karl Reinhard Graf zu Leiningen-Dagsburg-Heidesheim was born on 7 July 1695. (2) He was the son of Johann Karl August Graf zu Leiningen-Dagsburg-Heidesheim and Johanna Magdalene Gräfin zu Hanau-Lichtenberg. (1) He m
2 CONC arried Katherine Polyxene Gräfin zu Solms-Rödelheim und Assenheim, daughter of Ludwig Graf zu Solms-Rödelheim and Charlotte Sibylla Ahlefeld, Countess af Ahlefeld, on 27 November 1726. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 17 November 1766 at age 71. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Christian Karl Reinhard Graf zu Leiningen-Dagsburg-Heidesheim and Katherine Polyxene Gräfin zu Solms-Rödelheim und Assenheim
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Marie Luise Gräfin zu Leiningen-Dagsburg-Heidesheim+3 b. 16 Mar 1729, d. 11 Mar 1818
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Karoline Felicitas Gräfin zu Leiningen-Langsberg-Heidesheim+ b. 22 May 1734, d. 8 May 1810
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p291.htm#i2903
