0 @N6000000004162202937@ NOTE [Ramey.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 5, Ed. 1, Tree #2958, Date of Import: Jul 16, 2001]
1 CONT
1 CONT Because of the Huguenot persecution, he fled to England, and subsequently to the Virginia under the indenture system. He was bound to Nicholas Spencer and landed at Westmoreland County in 1655.  Nicholas Spencer was appointed Secr
1 CONC etary of the Colony of Virginiaduring the pleasure of King Charles II.
1 CONT
1 CONT  Westmoreland County, VA Deed book 1, p 403 , show Jacob Remey is deeded 200 acres in Nominee Forestin Cople Parish 21 Jul 1671
