0 @N6000000002322291513@ NOTE She was the daughter of George Louis, elector of Hanover (later George I,
1 CONT king of England). Her husband's vocation was the army and Prince Leopold I of
1 CONT Anhalt-Dessau became his lifelong friend & principle advisor in military
1 CONT matters. Frederick spent the rest of his life building the Prussian Army into
1 CONT Europe's best fighting instrument, as well as resolved to make his state
1 CONT financially independent. In 1713, Prussian armed forces numbered 38,000, but
1 CONT by his death, 1740, the army numbered 83,000 from a population of 2.2 million.
